entals, games, activations, equipment, custom setups, and related event services. The client submits the request to Eventies, and Eventies coordinates with registered vendors and service providers to review availability, pricing, logistics, setup requirements, and next steps."]],["P",{},["SPAN",{},"The customer-facing relationship is with Eventies. Vendors and service providers may be used by Eventies to help execute or supply parts of the service."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"3. Service locations"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"Eventies services are primarily available in Jordan and may be available in other locations subject to availability, vendor coverage, logistics, and confirmation by Eventies. Submitting a request for a location does not guarantee that service is available there."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"4. Eligibility"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"You must be at least 18 years old to use Eventies, create an account, submit a request, or enter into a booking or payment arrangement with Eventies."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"5. Accounts"],["UL",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"You must provide accurate and up-to-date account and contact information."]]],["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"You are responsible for keeping your login details secure."]]],["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Eventies may suspend or restrict accounts if we believe they are being misused, contain inaccurate information, or create risk for Eventies, users, vendors, or the website."]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"6. Requests are not confirmed bookings"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"Submitting a rental request, purchase quote request, custom build inquiry, or contact form does not create a confirmed booking. A request becomes confirmed only after Eventies reviews the details, checks availability and logistics, confirms pricing and scope, and communicates confirmation to you."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"7. Pricing, availability, and scope"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"Prices, availability, delivery, setup, staffing, quantities, product details, and service scope may depend on date, location, event size, request details, vendor availability, and logistics. Any price or listing shown on the website is subject to review and confirmation unless Eventies clearly states otherwise in writing."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"8. Payment and deposits"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"Eventies does not currently process online payments through the website. Payment, deposit, or advance-payment instructions may be communicated after request review and confirmation. Any deposit or advance payment is non-refundable unless Eventies states otherwise in writing."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"9. Customer responsibilities"],["UL",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Provide accurate event date, location, venue access, contact, quantity, and setup information."]]],["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Make sure the venue allows the requested services, equipment, delivery, electricity, installation, and activity type."]]],["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Provide safe access, reasonable setup time, and any permits or approvals needed for the event."]]],["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Use products, equipment, games, and services responsibly and follow instructions provided by Eventies or the service team."]]],["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Pay for damage, loss, missing items, misuse, excessive cleaning, or repairs caused by you, your guests, venue, or event participants."]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"10. Changes, cancellation, and refunds"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"Cancellations and refund rules are explained in the Refund Policy. In general, cancellation requests must be made at least 72 hours before the event, and deposits or advance payments are non-refundable unless Eventies confirms otherwise in writing."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"11. Service issues"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"If a product or service arrives with a problem, Eventies will review the issue and work to provide a reasonable solution, which may include repair, replacement, alternative arrangement, service adjustment, or another suitable response depending on the situation."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"12. Prohibited use"],["UL",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Do not misuse the website, submit false information, impersonate others, interfere with security, scrape content without permission, or use Eventies for unlawful, harmful, abusive, or fraudulent activity."]]],["LI",{"class":"flex gap-3"},["SPAN",{"class":"mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-violet-500","aria-hidden":"true"}],["SPAN",{},["SPAN",{},"Do not upload or send content that violates rights, contains malicious code, or is offensive, unsafe, misleading, or illegal."]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"13. Website content and intellectual property"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"The Eventies name, website design, text, media, logos, and platform content are owned by Eventies or used with permission. You may not copy, reproduce, modify, resell, or use Eventies content for commercial purposes without written permission."]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"rounded-[28px] border border-violet-100/90 bg-white/88 p-5 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-50px_rgba(89,23,196,0.35)] sm:p-7"},["H2",{"class":"text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-950 sm:text-2xl"},"14. Limitation of liability"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-8 text-ink-700/82 sm:text-[15px] sm:leading-8"},["P",{},["SPAN",{},"To the maximum extent allowed by applicable law, Eventies is not liable for indirect, incidental, special, or consequential losses. Eventies is not responsible for delays or failures caused by incorrect customer information, venue restrictions, force majeure events, third-party issues, or circumstances outside reasonable control."]]]],["SECTION",{